（3）$\frac1{12}$.

【解】当 $x\to0$ 时，有 $e^{x^4}-1\sim x^4$，故

$$
\begin{aligned}
\text{原式}
&=\lim_{x\to0}\frac{e^{x^2}-e^{2-2\cos x}}{x^4}\\
&=\lim_{x\to0}e^{2-2\cos x}\cdot\frac{e^{x^2-2+2\cos x}-1}{x^4}\\
&=\lim_{x\to0}\frac{x^2-2+2\cos x}{x^4}\\
&=\lim_{x\to0}\frac{2x-2\sin x}{4x^3}\\
&=\frac12\lim_{x\to0}\frac{1-\cos x}{3x^2}\\
&=\frac16\lim_{x\to0}\frac{\frac12x^2}{x^2}
=\frac1{12}.
\end{aligned}
$$

【注】解答中

$$
\lim_{x\to0}\frac{e^{x^2}-e^{2-2\cos x}}{x^4}
=\lim_{x\to0}e^{2-2\cos x}\cdot\frac{e^{x^2-2+2\cos x}-1}{x^4},
$$

这一步采取的方法是分子提取公因式 $e^{2-2\cos x}$，提取公因式是考研试题中常用的技巧。

一般有三种情形常可考虑提取公因式：①$\infty-\infty$；②指数函数；③幂函数。

三、解答题

（1）【解】由已知得，

$$
af(x)+bf\left(\frac1x\right)=\frac cx, \tag{①}
$$

在①式中用 $\frac1x$ 代替 $x$，得

$$
af\left(\frac1x\right)+bf(x)=cx. \tag{②}
$$

再由①$\times a-$②$\times b$，得

$$
(a^2-b^2)f(x)=\frac{ac}{x}-bcx,
$$

由 $|a|\ne|b|$，故

$$
f(x)=\frac{c}{a^2-b^2}\left(\frac ax-bx\right).
$$

而

$$
f(-x)=\frac{c}{a^2-b^2}\left(-\frac ax+bx\right)=-f(x),
$$

所以 $f(x)$ 是奇函数。

（2）【解】（Ⅰ）

$$
\begin{aligned}
\lim_{x\to\infty}\frac{x^2-x\sin x}{x^2+x\sin\frac1x}
&=\lim_{x\to\infty}\frac{1-\frac1x\sin x}{1+\frac1x\sin\frac1x}\\
&=1.
\end{aligned}
$$

（Ⅱ）由于

$$
\begin{aligned}
\lim_{x\to+\infty}\left(\frac{a^{\frac1x}+b^{\frac1x}+c^{\frac1x}}3\right)^x
&=\lim_{x\to+\infty}\left(\frac{3+a^{\frac1x}+b^{\frac1x}+c^{\frac1x}-3}{3}\right)^{
\frac{3}{a^{\frac1x}+b^{\frac1x}+c^{\frac1x}-3}
\cdot
\frac{a^{\frac1x}+b^{\frac1x}+c^{\frac1x}-3}{3\cdot\frac1x}},
\end{aligned}
$$

所以

$$
\begin{aligned}
\lim_{x\to+\infty}
\frac{a^{\frac1x}+b^{\frac1x}+c^{\frac1x}-3}{3\cdot\frac1x}
&=\lim_{x\to+\infty}
\frac{\left(a^{\frac1x}-1\right)+\left(b^{\frac1x}-1\right)+\left(c^{\frac1x}-1\right)}
{3\cdot\frac1x}\\
&=\frac13(\ln a+\ln b+\ln c)
=\ln(abc)^{\frac13}.
\end{aligned}
$$

故原式 $=e^{\ln(abc)^{\frac13}}=(abc)^{\frac13}$。

（Ⅲ）

$$
\begin{aligned}
\lim_{x\to0}
\frac{\ln(\sin^2x+e^x)-x}{\ln(e^{2x}-x^2)-2x}
&=\lim_{x\to0}
\frac{\ln(\sin^2x+e^x)-\ln e^x}
{\ln(e^{2x}-x^2)-\ln e^{2x}}\\
&=\lim_{x\to0}
\frac{\ln\left(1+\frac{\sin^2x}{e^x}\right)}
{\ln\left(1-\frac{x^2}{e^{2x}}\right)}\\
&=\lim_{x\to0}
\frac{\frac{\sin^2x}{e^x}}{-\frac{x^2}{e^{2x}}}\\
&=\lim_{x\to0}(-e^x)\frac{\sin^2x}{x^2}\\
&=-1.
\end{aligned}
$$

（IV）
$$
\begin{aligned}
\lim_{x\to0}\frac{(1+x)^{\frac{3}{x}}-e^3}{x}
&=\lim_{x\to0}\frac{e^{\frac{3\ln(1+x)}{x}}-e^3}{x}\\
&=e^3\lim_{x\to0}\frac{e^{\frac{3\ln(1+x)}{x}-3}-1}{x}\\
&=e^3\lim_{x\to0}\frac{\frac{3\ln(1+x)}{x}-3}{x}\\
&=3e^3\lim_{x\to0}\frac{\ln(1+x)-x}{x^2}\\
&=3e^3\lim_{x\to0}\frac{\frac{1}{1+x}-1}{2x}
=-\frac{3}{2}e^3.
\end{aligned}
$$

（V）
$$
\begin{aligned}
\lim_{x\to0}\frac{e^{\tan x}-e^x}{x^3}
&=\lim_{x\to0}e^x\frac{e^{\tan x-x}-1}{x^3}\\
&=\lim_{x\to0}e^x\cdot\frac{\tan x-x}{x^3}
=\lim_{x\to0}\frac{\frac{1}{3}x^3}{x^3}
=\frac{1}{3}.
\end{aligned}
$$

（VI）
$$
\begin{aligned}
\lim_{x\to0}\cot x\left(\frac{1}{\sin x}-\frac{1}{x}\right)
&=\lim_{x\to0}\frac{x-\sin x}{\tan x\cdot\sin x\cdot x}\\
&=\lim_{x\to0}\frac{x-\sin x}{x^3}\\
&=\lim_{x\to0}\frac{1-\cos x}{3x^2}
=\lim_{x\to0}\frac{\frac{1}{2}x^2}{3x^2}
=\frac{1}{6}.
\end{aligned}
$$

（VII）由于
$$
\lim_{x\to0}(1-x^2)^{\frac{1}{1-\sqrt{1-x^2}}}
=\lim_{x\to0}\left[(1-x^2)^{-\frac12}\right]^{\frac{-2}{1-\sqrt{1-x^2}}},
$$

且
$$
\begin{aligned}
\lim_{x\to0}\frac{-x^2}{1-\sqrt{1-x^2}}
&=\lim_{x\to0}\frac{-x^2(1+\sqrt{1-x^2})}{x^2}\\
&=-2,
\end{aligned}
$$

故原式 $=e^{-2}$。

（VIII）
$$
\begin{aligned}
\lim_{x\to0^+}x^{\sin x}
&=\lim_{x\to0^+}e^{\sin x\ln x}
=e^{\lim_{x\to0^+}\sin x\ln x}\\
&=e^{\lim_{x\to0^+}x\ln x}
=e^{\lim_{x\to0^+}\frac{\ln x}{\frac1x}}
=e^{\lim_{x\to0^+}\frac{\frac1x}{-\frac1{x^2}}}
=e^0=1.
\end{aligned}
$$

（3）【解】（I）依题意，得
$$
\frac{\frac12n(n+1)}{n^2+n+n}
\leqslant
\frac{1}{n^2+n+1}+\frac{2}{n^2+n+2}+\cdots+\frac{n}{n^2+n+n}
\leqslant
\frac{\frac12n(n+1)}{n^2+n+1}.
$$

而
$$
\lim_{n\to\infty}\frac{\frac12n(n+1)}{n^2+n+n}
=\frac12,\qquad
\lim_{n\to\infty}\frac{\frac12n(n+1)}{n^2+n+1}
=\frac12,
$$

故根据夹逼准则，原式 $=\frac12$。

（II）
$$
\begin{aligned}
&\lim_{n\to\infty}\left[\sqrt{1+2+\cdots+n}-\sqrt{1+2+\cdots+(n-1)}\right]\\
&=\lim_{n\to\infty}\left[\sqrt{\frac{n(n+1)}2}-\sqrt{\frac{n(n-1)}2}\right]\\
&=\lim_{n\to\infty}\frac1{\sqrt2}\cdot
\frac{2n}{\sqrt{n(n+1)}+\sqrt{n(n-1)}}
=\frac{\sqrt2}{2}.
\end{aligned}
$$

（III）由
$$
\frac{1}{4n^2-1}
=\frac12\left(\frac{1}{2n-1}-\frac{1}{2n+1}\right),
$$

知
$$
\begin{aligned}
\sum_{k=1}^n\frac{1}{4k^2-1}
&=\frac12\left[\left(1-\frac13\right)+\left(\frac13-\frac15\right)+\cdots+\left(\frac{1}{2n-1}-\frac{1}{2n+1}\right)\right]\\
&=\frac12\left(1-\frac{1}{2n+1}\right),
\end{aligned}
$$

故原式
$$
=\lim_{n\to\infty}\frac12\left(1-\frac{1}{2n+1}\right)
=\frac12.
$$

（IV）由于
$$
1\leqslant\sqrt[n]{1+\frac12+\cdots+\frac1n}\leqslant\sqrt[n]{n},
$$

且 $\lim\limits_{n\to\infty}\sqrt[n]{n}=1$，故由夹逼准则，知原式 $=1$。

（V）
$$
\lim_{n\to\infty}\left(\frac{1+\sqrt[n]{3}}2\right)^n
=\lim_{n\to\infty}\left[1+\left(\frac{1+\sqrt[n]{3}}2-1\right)\right]^n.
$$

**(14)** $\frac{3}{2}\pi^2+4\pi$。

【解】如图 3-2 所示，

$$
\begin{aligned}
V
&=\int_{0}^{\pi}\pi(\sin x+1)^2\,dx\\
&=\pi\int_{0}^{\pi}\left(1+2\sin x+\frac{1-\cos2x}{2}\right)\,dx\\
&=\pi\left(\frac32x-2\cos x-\frac14\sin2x\right)\bigg|_{0}^{\pi}\\
&=\frac32\pi^2+4\pi.
\end{aligned}
$$

**(15)** $\frac{4}{15}$。

【解】

$$
\begin{aligned}
\lim_{x\to0}\left(\frac{n-x}{n+x}\right)^{\frac{2}{x}}
&=\lim_{x\to0}\left[\left(1-\frac{2x}{n+x}\right)^{\frac{n+x}{2x}}\right]^{-\frac{4}{n+x}}
=e^{-\frac{4}{n}},
\end{aligned}
$$

$$
\begin{aligned}
\int_{\frac1n}^{+\infty}xe^{-4x}\,dx
&=-\frac14xe^{-4x}\bigg|_{\frac1n}^{+\infty}
+\frac14\int_{\frac1n}^{+\infty}e^{-4x}\,dx\\
&=\frac{1}{4n}e^{-\frac4n}
-\frac1{16}e^{-4x}\bigg|_{\frac1n}^{+\infty}\\
&=\frac{1}{4n}e^{-\frac4n}
+\frac1{16}e^{-\frac4n}.
\end{aligned}
$$

故

$$
\left(\frac{1}{4n}+\frac1{16}\right)e^{-\frac4n}
=e^{-\frac4n},
$$

解得 $n=\frac4{15}$。

**(16)** $4;\ 1-5e^{-2}$。

【解】依题设，所求路程为

$$
\begin{aligned}
s
&=\int_{0}^{+\infty}\sqrt{t}e^{-\sqrt{t}}\,dt
\overset{\sqrt{t}=u}{=}
\int_{0}^{+\infty}ue^{-u}\cdot2u\,du
=-2\int_{0}^{+\infty}u^2\,d(e^{-u})\\
&=-2\left(u^2e^{-u}\bigg|_{0}^{+\infty}
-\int_{0}^{+\infty}2ue^{-u}\,du\right)\\
&=-4\int_{0}^{+\infty}u\,d(e^{-u})\\
&=-4\left(ue^{-u}\bigg|_{0}^{+\infty}
-\int_{0}^{+\infty}e^{-u}\,du\right)\\
&=-4e^{-u}\bigg|_{0}^{+\infty}
=4(\mathrm{m}).
\end{aligned}
$$

所求平均速度为

$$
\begin{aligned}
\bar v
&=\frac14\int_{0}^{4}\sqrt{t}e^{-\sqrt{t}}\,dt
\overset{-\sqrt{t}=u}{=}
-\frac12\int_{-2}^{0}u^2e^u\,du\\
&=\frac12\int_{-2}^{0}u^2\,d(e^u)\\
&=\frac12\left(u^2e^u\bigg|_{-2}^{0}
-\int_{-2}^{0}2ue^u\,du\right)\\
&=\frac12\left[-4e^{-2}-2\int_{-2}^{0}u\,d(e^u)\right]\\
&=-2e^{-2}-\left(ue^u\bigg|_{-2}^{0}
-\int_{-2}^{0}e^u\,du\right)\\
&=-2e^{-2}-2e^{-2}+e^u\bigg|_{-2}^{0}\\
&=1-5e^{-2}(\mathrm{m}/\mathrm{s}).
\end{aligned}
$$

# 三、解答题

**(1)** 【解】（Ⅰ）

$$
\begin{aligned}
\int\frac{2^x\cdot3^x}{9^x-4^x}\,dx
&=\int\frac{6^x\,dx}{4^x\left[\left(\frac94\right)^x-1\right]}\\
&=\int\frac{\left(\frac32\right)^x\,dx}
{\left[\left(\frac32\right)^x\right]^2-1}\\
&=\frac{1}{\ln\frac32}
\int\frac{d\left[\left(\frac32\right)^x\right]}
{\left[\left(\frac32\right)^x\right]^2-1}\\
&=\frac{1}{2\ln\frac32}
\ln\left|\frac{\left(\frac32\right)^x-1}
{\left(\frac32\right)^x+1}\right|+C\\
&=\frac{1}{2\ln\frac32}
\ln\left|\frac{3^x-2^x}{3^x+2^x}\right|+C.
\end{aligned}
$$

【注】

$$
\int\frac{dx}{x^2-1}
=\frac12\ln\left|\frac{x-1}{x+1}\right|+C.
$$

解上述方程组，得 $x=y=\frac{\sqrt{2a}}{4}$，故

$$
S_{\min}=\frac{1}{2}\cdot
\frac{a^2}{a+8\cdot\frac{\sqrt{2a}}{4}\cdot\frac{\sqrt{2a}}{4}}
=\frac{1}{4},
$$

解得 $a=1$.

(8) 【解】视 $\xi,\eta$ 为中间变量，$x,y$ 为自变量。

由已知，得

$$
\frac{\partial u}{\partial x}
=\frac{\partial u}{\partial \xi}\cdot 1+\frac{\partial u}{\partial \eta}\cdot 1,
$$

$$
\frac{\partial u}{\partial y}
=\frac{\partial u}{\partial \xi}\cdot a+\frac{\partial u}{\partial \eta}\cdot b,
$$

这里 $\frac{\partial u}{\partial \xi},\frac{\partial u}{\partial \eta}$ 是以 $\xi,\eta$ 为中间变量，$x,y$ 为自变量的二元函数，故

$$
\frac{\partial^2u}{\partial x^2}
=\frac{\partial^2u}{\partial \xi^2}
+2\frac{\partial^2u}{\partial \xi\partial\eta}
+\frac{\partial^2u}{\partial\eta^2},
$$

$$
\frac{\partial^2u}{\partial y^2}
=a^2\frac{\partial^2u}{\partial \xi^2}
+2ab\frac{\partial^2u}{\partial \xi\partial\eta}
+b^2\frac{\partial^2u}{\partial\eta^2},
$$

$$
\frac{\partial^2u}{\partial x\partial y}
=a\frac{\partial^2u}{\partial \xi^2}
+(a+b)\frac{\partial^2u}{\partial \xi\partial\eta}
+b\frac{\partial^2u}{\partial\eta^2}.
$$

代入已知方程，得

$$
\begin{aligned}
\frac{\partial^2u}{\partial x^2}
+4\frac{\partial^2u}{\partial x\partial y}
+3\frac{\partial^2u}{\partial y^2}
={}&(1+4a+3a^2)\frac{\partial^2u}{\partial \xi^2}\\
&+[2+4(a+b)+6ab]\frac{\partial^2u}{\partial \xi\partial\eta}\\
&+(1+4b+3b^2)\frac{\partial^2u}{\partial\eta^2}.
\end{aligned}
$$

又由已知，得

$$
\left\{
\begin{aligned}
1+4a+3a^2&=0, \qquad ①\\
1+4b+3b^2&=0, \qquad ②\\
2+4(a+b)+6ab&\ne 0. \qquad ③
\end{aligned}
\right.
$$

联立①式和②式，解得

$$
\left\{
\begin{aligned}
a&=-1,\\
b&=-\frac{1}{3}
\end{aligned}
\right.
\text{或}
\left\{
\begin{aligned}
a&=-\frac{1}{3},\\
b&=-1,
\end{aligned}
\right.
$$

且都满足③式，故为所求。

(9) 【解】令 $e^x\sin y=u$，则

$$
\frac{\partial z}{\partial x}=f'(u)e^x\sin y,\qquad
\frac{\partial z}{\partial y}=f'(u)e^x\cos y,
$$

$$
\frac{\partial^2z}{\partial x^2}
=f'(u)e^x\sin y+f''(u)e^{2x}\sin^2y,
$$

$$
\frac{\partial^2z}{\partial y^2}
=-f'(u)e^x\sin y+f''(u)e^{2x}\cos^2y.
$$

代入原方程，得 $f''(u)-f(u)=0$，此为二阶线性齐次微分方程，解得

$$
f(u)=C_1e^u+C_2e^{-u}\ (C_1,C_2\text{ 为任意常数}).
$$

